         what="Press R. The last eight seconds of your fight are pulled out of you. A white figure with gold seams and no face stands up where you were eight seconds ago and does exactly what you did: the same steps, the same powers, at the same moments, at 60% strength. Meanwhile you're free to do something else.",
         thrill="You get to fight beside yourself, and you can plan for it. Set up a Well, throw a punch, press R, and spend the next eight seconds doing what your past self couldn't. When your old Well meets your new Nova, that's a Duet, and you played both halves.",
